=== text ===
|                                                              |
|  Add a Divide method that rejects a zero divisor             |
|                                                              |
|                                                              |
|  I'll inspect the calculator package, add division with an   |
|  explicit error for a zero divisor, then write tests and     |
|  run them.                                                   |
|                                                              |
|  1. Find the source and tests.                               |
|  2. Read the existing implementation.                        |
|  3. Add the method and regression tests.                     |
|  4. Run the package tests.                                   |
|                                                              |
|  Glob calculator/*.go                                        |
|                                                              |
|  The package has a source file and a test file. I'll find    |
|  the existing methods to match their style.                  |
|                                                              |
|  Grep ^func \(c \*Calculator\) [3 matches]                   |
|                                                              |
|  Every method lives in calc.go. I'll check whether a         |
|  divide file exists already.                                 |
|                                                              |
|  Read calculator/divide.go [tool execution failed]           |
|                                                              |
|  There is no divide file, so Divide belongs in calc.go.      |
|  I'll read it.                                               |
|                                                              |
|  Read calculator/calc.go                                     |
|                                                              |
|  calc.go has no imports yet, so I'll add the import after    |
|  the package clause.                                         |
|                                                              |
|  Edit calculator/calc.go                                     |
|  Edit calculator/calc.go                                     |
|                                                              |
|  The method returns (float64, error) and rejects a zero      |
|  divisor without changing the other operations. I'll check   |
|  the existing test style before adding coverage.             |
|                                                              |
|  Read calculator/calc_test.go                                |
|                                                              |
|  I'll add a separate test file for successful division and   |
|  the zero-divisor error. The assertions will check both      |
|  return values.                                              |
|                                                              |
|  Write calculator/divide_test.go                             |
|                                                              |
|  I'll run just the new tests first.                          |
|                                                              |
|  Bash go test ./calculator/... -run 'TestDivide|T… [exit 1]  |
|                                                              |
|  TestDivide expected integer division, but Divide returns    |
|  a float64. I'll fix the expectation.                        |
|                                                              |
|  Edit calculator/divide_test.go                              |
|                                                              |
|  I'll run the whole package with verbose output.             |
|                                                              |
|  Bash go test ./calculator/... -v                            |
|                                                              |
|  The tests pass.                                             |
